⚙️ Component Map within JSON Configuration

Orchestrator Agent Node (gpt-4o-mini): 
Equipped with your custom System Prompt to output structural validation fields. Langflow evaluates the intent_classification property inside its downstream gateway.
Specialized Agent Layer (gpt-4o): Executed on-demand depending on conditional matches.
Chained Flow Mechanics: The Status Reporter Agent node pipe explicitly connects its payload directly into the inputs of the Milestone Tracker Agent to enable proactive tracking natively without requiring manual stakeholder re-routing.
